	<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">Croitearachd</skos:prefLabel>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A system of working the land through small holdings called crofts. Following the highland clearances and the 1884 Crofters War, the Crofters Holdings (Scotland) Act 1886, or Crofters' Charter, granted crofters' rights over rents, security of tenure etc.</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

