	<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">Linn an Umha Meadhon</skos:prefLabel>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The second subdivision of the Bronze Age. New forms of metalwork appear, including louped spearheads, dirks and rapiers. Bucket urns appear in the pottery record.</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

