	<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">Na Meadhan Aoisean</skos:prefLabel>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The Medieval period or Middle Ages arbitarily begins with the death of Malcolm III Canmore in 1093 until James VI inherited the English throne in 1603.</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

