	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Referring to the Flavian dynasty who were Emperors of Rome in 69-96 BCE. In Scotland, evidence usually dates from the early 70s until the mid 80s CE.</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

