	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Referring to the Severan dynasty who were Emperors of Rome in 193-235 C.E. In Scotland, Severan relates to the campaigns of the Emperor Septimius Severus and his sons between 208-211 C.E</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

