	<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Upper Palaeolithic</skos:prefLabel>
	<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">(todo)</skos:prefLabel>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The 'Old Stone Age' from the earliest appearance of humans in Britain to the end of the last Ice Age around 10,000 years BCE. Characterized by the development of fine blade flint tools and projectile points made from bony materials.</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

